  - text: "\"I think I locked myself out. Could I use your phone for a second?\"\r"
    isGood: 1
  - text: "\"Sorry, do you have any bandages?\"\r"
    isGood: 1
  - text: "\"My umbrella broke outside. Could I borrow one until tomorrow?\"\r"
    isGood: 1
